WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:06.267
Cybersecurity training. Module 8. Handling information and physical security.

2
00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:14.200
Information on paper, on a screen or in a conversation can be seen or heard by people nearby.

3
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:18.400
Who needs it? Is this person part of the task?

4
00:00:18.767 --> 00:00:22.433
How much? Only what answers the question.

5
00:00:22.767 --> 00:00:27.733
By which way? The approved system, not personal email or chat.

6
00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:33.000
Do not hold the door because someone looks like they are working.

7
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.567
A uniform proves nothing.

8
00:00:34.933 --> 00:00:40.133
Politely ask them to use their own access, or to ring or check in with the front desk.

9
00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:45.900
Shred paper with sensitive details, or return it as instructed.

10
00:00:46.233 --> 00:00:50.467
Keep notes with sensitive details locked away when you are done.

11
00:00:50.833 --> 00:00:56.033
If you are not sure how to dispose of something, keep it safe and ask.

12
00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:57.967
Pause.

13
00:00:58.367 --> 00:00:59.200
Verify.

14
00:00:59.567 --> 00:01:00.667
Report fast.

15
00:01:01.067 --> 00:01:02.800
Now read the module.
